{"text": "Suddenly the scene changes, and now he stands at the gate of his own home, which shines in the bright morning sunshine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He must have traveled the whole night, for everything is just as he left it, bright and beautiful and peaceful. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As he pushes open the gate and walks up the path, he sees a flutter of white clothes near the house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His wife, looking fresh and sweet, steps down from the veranda and waits for him at the bottom of the stairs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She stands there smiling with a joy that cannot be put into words, and he runs forward with his arms wide open. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just as he is about to hold her, he feels a stunning blow on the back of his neck. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A blinding white light blazes all around him with a sound like a cannon, and then all is darkness and silence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Peyton Farquhar was dead, his body swinging gently from side to side beneath the timbers of the Owl Creek bridge.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "u", "d", "d", "e", "n", "l", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "c", "e", "n", "e", " ", "c", "h", "a", "n", "g", "e", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "n", "o", "w", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "a", "n", "d", "s", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "a", "t", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "o", "w", "n", " ", "h", "o", "m", "e", ",", " ", "w", "h", "i", "c", "h", " ", "s", "h", "i", "n", "e", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "s", "u", "n", "s", "h", "i", "n", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "m", "u", "s", "t", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "t", "r", "a", "v", "e", "l", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "h", "o", "l", "e", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", ",", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "